topics.body:
A node federates through ActivityPub and nothing beside it. {{standard:activitypub}} supplies actors, inboxes, outboxes and delivery; {{standard:activitystreams}} supplies the vocabulary; {{standard:webfinger}} and {{standard:nodeinfo}} make actors and nodes discoverable.

{{clause:one-face}}

{{clause:no-direct-a2a}}

{{clause:signed-admission}}

{{clause:closed-inbox}}

An ActivityPub++ activity is an ordinary ActivityStreams activity whose object is one document naming one envelope.

{{clause:activity-types}}

{{clause:object-document}}

{{clause:data-uri}}

{{clause:data-uri-digest}}

{{clause:size-bound}}

{{clause:size-bound-receiver}}

{{clause:agent-card}}

{{clause:https}}

{{clause:activity-id}}

The object therefore has this shape, with the envelope's bytes inline ({{standard:data-url}}):

```json
{
  "@context": "https://www.w3.org/ns/activitystreams",
  "id": "https://node.example/activities/sen-<digest>",
  "type": "Offer",
  "actor": "https://node.example/actors/seller",
  "to": "https://peer.example/actors/buyer",
  "object": {
    "type": "Document",
    "mediaType": "application/sen+cbor",
    "name": "ni:///sha-256;<envelope digest>",
    "url": { "type": "Link", "mediaType": "application/sen+cbor",
             "href": "data:application/sen+cbor;base64,<envelope bytes>" }
  },
  "attachment": { "type": "Link", "mediaType": "application/json",
                  "name": "A2A Agent Card", "href": "https://node.example/.well-known/agent-card.json" }
}
```

The envelope is a CloudEvents event ({{standard:cloudevents}}) whose fields bind it to the activity that carries it.

{{clause:ce-version}}

{{clause:ce-binding}}

{{clause:ce-type}}

{{clause:ce-data}}

{{clause:ce-id}}

{{clause:ce-id-receiver}}

{{clause:ce-time}}

The envelope's data is one message in the Agent2Agent protocol ({{standard:a2a}}). The message, not the activity, is where the operation is stated.

{{clause:a2a-role}}

{{clause:a2a-sen-part}}

{{clause:a2a-part-ni}}

{{clause:a2a-part-ni-receiver}}

{{clause:sen-normalized}}

{{clause:card-signed}}

Payment and authority ride inside the agent message. They are never sibling labels on the activity. Payment is {{standard:x402}}.

{{clause:no-sibling-labels}}

